// The front side: the astronaut's own screen. Idea, structure and logic: the human member of team
// "Just For Fun" (one dated message about body and mind, a short explanation, buttons, a choice; tell only
// when something is really wrong). Inspired by NASA's rules for crew screens (NASA-STD-3001 Vol 2 Rev F):
// a status bar that is always visible, colour that carries meaning, a list of alerts with what to do.
